  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_bill_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>this could be 1) a weapon of war, a kind of broadsword; 2) an obsolete military weapon used chiefly by infantry; 3) an implement used for pruning, cutting wood, lopping trees etc. having a long blade with a sharp hook at the end and a wooden handle in line with the blade (OED s.v. bill n.1), but none seems likely, since only one piece was imported</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
  </rdf:Description>
